\par\par \b \uc2  Banco de  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  to support peso. \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY, Dec 29 (Reuter) - Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the peso Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Yes it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the amount and the details will be announced in the next accounts report of the (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a spokeswoman for Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at between $20 million and $40 million. \par \par \uc2  "It \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with very little, between $20 million and $40 million at most, they wanted it to close around 7.70," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The widely-watched 48-hour peso closed two centavos stronger at 7.69/7.70 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The dollar selling became apparent after midday and it all corresponded to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a trader said. \par \par \uc2  The 24-hour peso closed 2.5 centavos weaker at 7.68/7.71 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was concentrated on the 48-hour contract, which because of a national holiday January 1 will fall due on Wednesday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the low amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was due to the thinness of the year-end \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "There were few real \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , by people who had to square their positions to close their books," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The same-day peso earlier closed five centavos weaker at 7.675/7.695 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289562 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drct009s8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
