\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2 's Intraday Peso Trading Stable After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 205 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1995\par 20:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY (AP-DJ)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso was trading in stable fashion amid very light volume in late intraday activity Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  City a little after 1900 GMT, on spot dollar markets, banking leader Banamex had the dollar trading at a mid rate of 7.7150 pesos against 7.7050 pesos at Thursday's close. Spreads were 7.7000/7.7300 pesos per dollar, compared with 7.6900/7.7200 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  As reported, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Friday, although a spokeswoman said she could not provide the amount and timing of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders, though, said the amount appeared to be quite small, and that it occurred around 1800 GMT. \par \par \uc2  'Volume has been very low, and I'd say it wasn't more than $30 million,' said a dealer with a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer with a large Mexican bank said the amount may even have been slightly less. \par \par \uc2  The spot dollar mid rate had moved as high as 7.7400 pesos shortly before 1800 GMT, according to traders. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-12-95 \par \par \uc2  1906GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drct0aa6q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley