\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2 's Peso Closes -2: Follows Dec. 8  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 1995\par 21:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Dealers said market players quickly grew wary after crossing the 7.80 marker in early trading. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at least three times since Nov. 9, a strategy that appears to have kept somewhat of a lid on speculative runs. \par \par \uc2  In the most recent confirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  said last Friday that it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Dec. 8, when the spot dollar rate was also flirting with closing above 7.80 pesos. \par \par \uc2  At least one trader with a major Mexican bank, though, said the threat of new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday may have created some pent-up demand for dollars. \par \par \uc2  'I'm seeing some real seasonal demand for dollars, but a lot of people held back today,' said the trader. 'At some point, those orders are probably going to be placed.' \par \par \uc2  Market observers expressed surprise over the Bank of Mexico's disclosure Wednesday night that it had spent $160 million to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market during the period Dec. 1 to Dec. 8. Most market players had estimated last week that the actual amount employed in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was closer to $60 million. \par \par \uc2  Some traders added that the peso found a bit of support despite seasonal pressures due to the recent rise in interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported Wednesday that the average interbank interest rate (TIIP) rose a hefty 5.2905 percentage points to 55.4250% from last week, while secondary money market rates also have climbed higher in recent days. \par \par \uc2  'There were probably some people taking advantage of the higher (secondary money market) rates, at least in the short term,' said one local trader. \par \par \uc2  Other traders, though, said foreign participation in the secondary market was quite slim Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-12-95 \par \par \uc2  2027GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drce0a1t0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
