\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Peso Closes Slightly Weaker Vs Dlr; Few Trades \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 1995\par 21:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexico's peso closed slightly weaker against the dollar in light volume Thursday, with the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rallying a bit in the final hours amid speculation that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  was poised to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  City, on spot dollar markets, banking leader Banamex quoted the dollar ending at a mid rate of 7.7650 pesos against 7.7550 pesos at Wednesday's close. Spreads were 7.7400/7.7900 pesos per dollar, compared with 7.7300/7.7800 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Other banks had the spot dollar ending a little higher. Banca Serfin and Inverlat gave a closing spot mid rate quote of 7.7800 pesos on a narrower spread of 7.7700/7.7900. \par \par \uc2  The spot dollar moved to 7.8150 pesos in the first 30 minutes of trading amid some traditional end-of-year demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said foreign investors in early trading were opting to cash in peso-based Mexican paper coming due. At the same time, some domestic businesses continued to lay the groundwork for the payment of dollar-linked loans and the financing of imports before January. \par \par \uc2  Dollar-buying orders eased in later trading, though, and several traders attributed the fall-off to concern over the prospect of renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'We didn't see any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the fear of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming in was definitely a major factor today,' said one local trader. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-12-95 \par \par \uc2  2002GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drce0a1rc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
