\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico News: Senate Passes Pension Reform Law \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 1995\par 17:15\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (DJ-EMR)--The following summary is based on Wednesday editions of the Mexico City dailies Reforma, La Jornada, El Financiero, El Economista and El Nacional. \par \par \uc2  -- The Mexican Senate Tuesday passed a law to reform the Mexican Social Security Institute system of public health care and pensions, all dailies reported. \par \par \uc2  -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to occasionally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to support the peso, El Financiero cited Finance Secretary Guillermo Ortiz as saying during a presentation to New York investors Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -- The peso's value will fall by nearly a third during 1996, El Economista cited Banamex and Merrill Lynch analysts saying in its banner headline. \par \par \uc2  Futures contracts traded at the Chicago Mercantile Exchange for March 1996, are trading at a level that would put the peso's value at 8.5616 to the dollar by that time, the paper said. \par \par \uc2  -- Confirmations, denials and other repercussions of a Tuesday NBC News report linking former President Carlos Salinas de Gortari with narcotics traffic topped headlines in Reforma, La Jornada, and EL Economista while radio talked show hosts seemed to speak of nothing else. \par \par \uc2  -- Mexico plans to negotiate double-taxation agreements with Argentina, Colombia, Costa Rica, China and Hungary during the first quarter of 1996, El Economista reported. \par \par \uc2  -- The government will take on $900 million of the debt of Ferrocarriles Nacionales Mexicanos (FNM,) in an effort to smooth a planned privatization of the national railroad company, El Economista reported. \par \par \uc2  -- Matt Smith \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES EMERGING MARKETS REPORT 12-13-95 \par \par \uc2  1115EST \par \par \uc2  1802 \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020011025drcd00d3v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
