ight\uc2 , meanwhile, reported consumer prices rose 2.5% in November, up from 2.1% in October. Some economists have predicted monthly inflation will hit 4% in December, due to seasonal factors and a hike in gas prices. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 11-12-95 \par \par \uc2  1553GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drcb09us1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
