\par\par \b \uc2  Mexican Stocks Open Slightly Higher Ahead of Peso \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 1995\par 16:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexican stocks drifted laterally Wednesday as traders remained cautious ahead of the opening of peso trading at 1500 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Just before 1500 GMT, the market's key IPC index was up 4.55 points to 2,246.08 - a increase of 0.2%. At the end of 1994, the IPC stood at 2,375.66. \par \par \uc2  Volume totaled 4.0 million pesos on 0.5 million shares traded. \par \par \uc2  Trading was thin as dealers waited for the opening of the peso market. \par \par \uc2  'The market is quiet, with few \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a dealer. 'Most traders are waiting to see the peso's direction.' \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lost 0.5% against the dollar Tuesday to sink to a historic closing low of 7.8100 pesos per dollar, despite some confirmed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the part of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the closing minutes. \par \par \uc2  For the eighth straight week, Cetes rates increased across the board in the Bank of Mexico's government securities auction Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The rate on Mexico's bellwether 28-day Cetes, or Treasury bill, rose 5.74 percentage points at weekly auction Tuesday to 59.99%, while the rate on 91-day Cetes rose 13.04 percentage points to 65.03%. \par \par \uc2  A lot of market players had expected 28-day paper to rise more than 10 percentage points. \par \par \uc2  Traders showed little reaction to the 1996 budget proposal delivered by Finance Minister Guillermo Ortiz to Congress Tuesday, which signalled no shifts in policy. \par \par \uc2  The IPC slipped 0.6% Tuesday after falling 2.4% on Monday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1501GMT \par \par \uc2  5047 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbf08z7g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
