\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico peso ends higher after  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  support. \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY, Nov 14 (Reuter) - Mexico's peso closed slightly stronger against the dollar after the Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the markets to help the beleaguered \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The 24-hour and 48-hour peso closed up three centavos at 7.72/7.79 per dollar after reeling to midday lows of 8.10/8.20 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  A Banco de Mexico spokesman told Reuters the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used a "small amount" of dollars to buy pesos on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, although he would not specify the amount. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated that Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold between $50 and $70 million. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was very small, but we had a very thin market, so it had a big effect," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  The peso reacted little following the announcement of Mexico's 1996 budget, which analysts said contained few surprises. \par \par \uc2  Mexican Finance Minister said during the presentation of the budget to Congress that the government would not let itself be bullied by \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators into changing its economic course of fiscal and monetary discipline and a free-floating peso. \par \par \uc2  The peso weakened in the morning on fears that the new budget would not convince investors that Mexico was setting realistic targets for next year, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Ortiz said the government used an average exchange rate during 1996 of 7.7 per dollar in calculating the budget. \par \par \uc2  While traders said this was unrealistic, analysts said the figure was slightly higher than many market projections. \par \par \uc2  -- Alexis Quiones, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289565 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drbe01u7i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
