\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Peso -4: Continues To Trade At 7.7500/Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1995\par 17:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Around 1600 GMT, the spot dollar continued to be quoted at a mid rate of 7.7500 pesos. \par \par \uc2  A trader with a Mexican bank said he saw domestic investors also seeking dollars. \par \par \uc2  'There's not much volume, but we have the problem again that there's no entry of dollars into the market,' the trader added. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investment funds appear to be keeping their distance despite sharp increases in interest rates. Bellwether 28-day primary Cetes rates rose 10.87 percentage points to 54.24% last Tuesday, and some market watchers are predicting rates could climb another 10 percentage points at this week's primary \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction. Secondary money market rates averaged 62.09% Friday, and moved into the mid-60s in early trading Monday. \par \par \uc2  'What's creating concern is that rates are so high, and still there doesn't seem to be a lot of interest,' said another trader. \par \par \uc2  Higher rates will place further strain on the Mexican banking sector and postpone prospects for an economic recovery, analysts have pointed out. \par \par \uc2  The peso closed Friday down 17% against the peso since September 20. The spot dollar ended October at 7.0650 pesos. \par \par \uc2  Despite Thursday's estimated $150-million \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  issued a statement late last week reiterating its commitment to a free-floating exchange rate regime. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official added Friday, however, that monetary authorities reserved the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on occasion 'in a discretionary manner.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1601GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbd08xgl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
