\par\par \b \uc2  Mexican Stocks Open Dn 0.6% In Cautious Trading Start \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1995\par 16:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexican stocks opened lower in thin volume Monday as most investors stayed on the sidelines ahead of the start of local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at 1500 GMT. \par \par \uc2  A little before 1500 GMT, the market's key IPC index was down 13.16 points to 2,296.94 - a drop of 0.6%. At the end of 1994, the IPC stood at 2,375.66. \par \par \uc2  Volume totaled 4.7 million pesos on 579,000 shares traded. \par \par \uc2  Traders attributed the early dip to concern over rising interest rates and cautiousness in the face of recent sharp peso declines. Bellwether 28-day primary Cetes rates rose 10.87 percentage points to 54.24% last Tuesday, and some market watchers are predicting rates could climb above 60% at this week's primary \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction. Secondary money market rates averaged 62.09% Friday. \par \par \uc2  An early decline in the Dow Jones Industrial Average was meanwhile creating pressure on Mexican ADRs traded in New York and causing negative spillover on the local market, traders added. \par \par \uc2  Most investors, though, wanted to see how the peso performs Monday before making any moves. \par \par \uc2  'Everybody's focus continues to be the peso,' said one local trader. \par \par \uc2  The spot dollar soared to a historic intraday high of 8.2500 pesos Thursday before some \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the part of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed it down to 7.5500 pesos. The peso ended even with the dollar Friday, but traders said another round of speculative attacks against the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not out of the question. \par \par \uc2  The IPC edged up 0.06 points last week amid light volume. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1502GMT \par \par \uc2  5047 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbd08xb6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
