\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Peso Opens -2: Vs 7.5500 At Thursday's Close \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 1995\par 16:12\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexico's peso opened weaker against the dollar Friday as some sell orders resurfaced following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  City a little after 1500 GMT, on spot dollar markets, banking leader Banamex quoted the dollar opening at a mid rate level of 7.6000 pesos against 7.5500 pesos at Thursday's close. Spreads were 7.5500/7.6500 pesos per dollar, compared with 7.5000/7.6000 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A local trader said volume appeared to be low in the opening minutes. \par \par \uc2  'There's not really signs of anything at this point,' the trader said. \par \par \uc2  As reported, \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the final minutes of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading Thursday to halt a major sell-off of pesos that had pushed the spot dollar as high as 8.2500 pesos in intraday trading. The spot dollar was trading around 8.0000 pesos when the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred. Mexican officials said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent about $150 million to buy pesos, dominating a market that has been characterized by thin trading. \par \par \uc2  Analysts had said late Thursday that it was unclear whether the move would stall recent speculative peso-selling pressures or invite further challenges. \par \par \uc2  The peso dived 4.0% against the dollar in very light volume Wednesday to end at a historic closing low of 7.8000 pesos per dollar. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1512GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drba08vnl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
