\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Peso Closes Mixed Vs. Dlr In Light Volume \b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 1995\par 21:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexico's peso closed mixed against the dollar in light volume Wednesday as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  largely upheld recent gains against its U.S. counterpart ahead of a four-day Easter Weekend beginning Thursday. \par \par \uc2  In Mexico City, on spot dollar markets, the dollar ended at mid rate levels of 6.2950 pesos per dollar against 6.2350 pesos per dollar at Tuesday's close. Spreads were 6.2700/6.3200 pesos per dollar, compared with 6.2100/6.2600 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The peso's cash mid rate, however, strengthened to 6.1350 pesos/dlr from 6.1750 pesos/dlr at Tuesday's close. The 24-hour mid rate, meanwhile, moved to 6.2850 pesos/dlr from 6.2250 pesos/dlr. \par \par \uc2  Traders said \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  players shied away from the peso at 24 hours and 48 hours because markets will be closed Thursday and Friday for holidays. \par \par \uc2  The peso remained popular in cash trading for foreign investors eager to capitalize on a secondary money market that has offered rates mostly above 70% in recent days, they added. \par \par \uc2  One Mexico City trader said the peso was hurt briefly when a major foreign bank sold some $150 million worth of pesos, prompting the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ensure the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained stable. \par \par \uc2  That report could not be confirmed, and other traders said they saw no signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers say the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not comment on rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but its governor reiterated last week it will not hesitate to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on occasion to ensure greater market stability. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said volume was light Wednesday, but heavier than in recent days. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 12-04-95 \par \par \uc2  1952GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4c02oro\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
