\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Mexico \highlight\uc2 's Mancera Reaffirms Tight Monetary Policy,  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  Option \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 April 1995\par 19:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 MEXICO\b0 \highlight\uc2  CITY (AP-DJ)--Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Miguel Mancera said Tuesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would maintain its strict monetary policy even if that meant further increases in already high interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Speaking at the annual convention of the Mexican National Securities Commission, Mancera also said Mexico's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not shy away from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to help stabilize the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'I think that to help the stabilization of the exchange rate and a quick reduction in inflation and later reduction in interest rates, it's necessary to accept a very strict monetary policy,' said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor. \par \par \uc2  'But one has to be aware that could imply important movements in interest rates as well as a certain minimum amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market,' he added. \par \par \uc2  As reported, rates on bellwether 28-day Cetes, or Treasury bills, fell 7.65 percentage points to 75.00% at last Wednesday's weekly primary auction. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have in the past said they will occasionally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but have refused to confirm when those \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have taken place. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in the months following the peso's initial Dec. 20 devaluation, but that there have been no recent signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 04-04-95 \par \par \uc2  1725GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr4402f08\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
