\par\par \b \uc2  Mexico's Peso Closes Stronger At 6.9000 To Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 21:04\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY (AP-DJ)--Mexico's peso closed stronger against the dollar Thursday to finish at its strongest level against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  since March 14. \par \par \uc2  In Mexico City, on spot and 24-hour dollar markets, the dollar ended at mid rate levels of 6.9000 pesos per dollar against 7.1000 pesos per dollar at Wednesday's close. Spreads were 6.8500/6.9500 pesos per dollar, compared with 7.0500/7.1500 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The volatile peso opened at 7.1300 pesos/dlr at 1500 GMT, weakened to 7.1900 pesos/dlr just before 1530 GMT and then strengthened to 6.7500 pesos/dlr around 1715 GMT before finding its closing level. \par \par \uc2  Most traders attributed the volatility to short-term speculation, and the peso's strengthening to the ripple effect of the dollar's rebound against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  One trader with a major Mexican bank, though, said the peso strengthened after telephone monopoly Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex) exchanged about $100 million in U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for pesos to cover its position. \par \par \uc2  Such an amount would have a major effect on the peso's fortunes in a market that all traders agreed was characterized by very low volume. \par \par \uc2  A trader with a smaller bank reported the peso also was helped by Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but other \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers discounted that report. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not comment on rumored \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 23-03-95 \par \par \uc2  2004GMT \par \par \uc2  1027 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3n0279e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
