\par\par \b \uc2  Mexican peso soars higher vs dlr on economic plan. \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MEXICO CITY, March 10 (Reuter) - The Mexican new peso rocketed off historic lows against the dollar following the government's announcement of a new economic plan, ending more than a peso higher in 24- and 48-hour contracts. \par \par \uc2  Traders said Banco de \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also helped the Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gain ground. \par \par \uc2  The 24- and 48-hour peso closed a full 1.2 new pesos stronger at 6.25/6.35 per dollar. Earlier the same-day peso closed 80 centavos higher at 6.55/6.75. \par \par \uc2  "The rise wasn't real in as much as Banco de Mxico came in and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  But others noted that \b \highlight22\uc2 Mexico\b0 \highlight\uc2 's drawing on $3 billion of a $20 billion U.S. aid facility Friday added real resources and heft to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's moves and would continue to do so from now on. \par \par \uc2  "The expectation is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will now be able to use that money to meet its commitments and will have more available to enter the market," another trader said. \par \par \uc2  The peso's gain followed the announcement of a tough fiscal plan to overcome Mexico's economic crisis. Authorities said they are aiming for an exchange rate of about 6 new pesos per dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Ivette Ceretti, Mexico City Bureau +525 728-9555 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr3a00hhz\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrd